OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786403882
OL,3,CMet Office considers rare extreme heat
OL,4,Cwarning as it forecasts 36C highs
OL,6,FTemperatures are set to climb again
OL,7,Fthis week, with highs of 36C forecast
OL,8,Fas the Met Office considers issuing
OL,9,Frare amber or red extreme heat
OL,10,Fwarnings.
OL,12,FParts of the UK are set to see their
OL,13,Ffifth heatwave of the summer as the
OL,14,Fcountry continues to bake in an
OL,15,Funprecedented period of dry, hot
OL,16,Fweather.
OL,18,FMonday will be slightly cooler before
OL,19,Ftemperatures rise again on Tuesday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
