FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786403882
OL,3,CMet Office considers rare extreme heat
OL,4,Cwarning as it forecasts 36C highs
OL,6,F"We'll probably see highs reaching the
OL,7,Fmid-30s quite widely on Wednesday, and
OL,8,Fon Thursday too for England and
OL,9,FWales," Met Office meteorologist Tom
OL,10,FMorgan said.
OL,12,FHe said temperatures could rise to 36C
OL,13,Fin the Midlands on Wednesday, with the
OL,14,Fheat spreading to the rest of England
OL,15,Fand Wales by Thursday.
OL,17,FHalf of England and all of Wales have
OL,18,Fbeen plunged into drought and more
OL,19,Fregions could be declared when
OL,20,Fofficials meet at the National Drought
OL,21,FGroup on Monday.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786403882
OL,3,CMet Office considers rare extreme heat
OL,4,Cwarning as it forecasts 36C highs
OL,6,FMorgan said: "If it wasn't for this
OL,7,Fincredible summer that we're currently
OL,8,Fseeing, then we'd be talking about
OL,9,Fthese temperatures as being really,
OL,10,Fvery unusual.
OL,12,F"But of course, we've had such an
OL,13,Fexceptional summer, people have become
OL,14,Fa bit used to it.
OL,16,F"There is a potential for impacts, so
OL,17,Fimpacts to infrastructure, things like
OL,18,Frailway lines and power networks,
OL,19,Fimpacts to vulnerable people as well."
OL,26,@nD@NOUtD@AOUxD@AOU{D@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
