PN,31204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786403882
OL,3,CMet Office considers rare extreme heat
OL,4,Cwarning as it forecasts 36C highs
OL,6,FHealth officials have warned of the
OL,7,Feffect on vulnerable people in the
OL,8,Fupcoming hot weather, with significant
OL,9,Fimpacts possible in health and social
OL,10,Fcare settings and a potential rise in
OL,11,Fdeaths because of the heat.
OL,13,FYellow heat health alerts issued by
OL,14,Fthe UK Health Security Agency are in
OL,15,Fplace for the East Midlands, West
OL,16,FMidlands, South East, South West, East
OL,17,Fof England, Yorkshire and the Humber,
OL,18,Fand London.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786403882
OL,3,CMet Office considers rare extreme heat
OL,4,Cwarning as it forecasts 36C highs
OL,6,FThe alerts remain in effect until 9pm
OL,7,Fon Tuesday, but may well be extended
OL,8,Fas the hot weather persists.
OL,10,FMeanwhile, the Met Office is
OL,11,Fconsidering issuing rare extreme heat
OL,12,Fwarnings ahead of the scorching
OL,13,Ftemperatures forecast later in the
OL,14,Fweek.
OL,16,F"We sometimes issue extreme heat
OL,17,Fwarnings, amber and red warnings,
OL,18,Fwhich we did back in June, so that's
OL,19,Funder consideration at the moment," Mr
OL,20,FMorgan said.
OL,26,@xD@AOU{D@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
