PN,31206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786403882
OL,3,CMet Office considers rare extreme heat
OL,4,Cwarning as it forecasts 36C highs
OL,6,FMore than 25 million people have
OL,7,Frestrictions on water use, the
OL,8,FEnvironment Agency said, with millions
OL,9,Funder hosepipe bans, including all
OL,10,FSouth East Water and Thames Water
OL,11,Fcustomers.
OL,13,FAnother record is set to tumble this
OL,14,Fweek after Sunday was the 34th day so
OL,15,Ffar this year when temperatures
OL,16,Fexceeded 30C somewhere in the UK,
OL,17,Fequalling the record from 1995.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
