PN,31208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786403882
OL,3,CMet Office considers rare extreme heat
OL,4,Cwarning as it forecasts 36C highs
OL,6,FThe European Union's earth observation
OL,7,Fprogramme Copernicus said average
OL,8,Ftemperatures across western Europe
OL,9,Freached 21.61C (70.92F) for June-July,
OL,10,Fbreaking the record set in 2022.
OL,12,FGlobally, this year is just behind
OL,13,F2024 and 2025 as the third hottest
OL,14,Fyear on record.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
